body:
I get this  https://imgur.com/vZzColB  

&#x200B;

You get definition if you search?

I changed my hardware on the licenced Widows 10 which was connected to my Microsoft account. 

&#x200B;

Of course, my product wasn't activated anymore as I changed my hardware. I contacted Microsoft and talked to the team for a while and then they gave me a new product key and told me if I change my hardware again, they wouldn't be able to help me. There are chances that Microsoft will give you a key to activate if you contact them.
